-- Retire the entity-mask GIN permanently.  The index's only intended readers
-- were four relation-band queries.  Those queries were also semantically wrong:
-- they inferred a relation type's governed band from the relation entity's
-- accumulated incident-edge mask.  They now use consensus.relation_mask_types,
-- which resolves the small relation vocabulary through the highway perfcache.
--
-- On the clean 2026-08-20 seed this partitioned GIN occupied 119 MB, had zero
-- scans, and every entities.highway_mask deposit maintained it.  That made all
-- 6.8M observed entity updates non-HOT.  This is a permanent schema correction,
-- not an ingest-time drop/rebuild cycle.
DO $do$
BEGIN
    BEGIN
        EXECUTE format('ALTER EXTENSION %I DROP INDEX laplace.entities_highway_bits_gin',
                       'laplace_substrate');
    EXCEPTION WHEN OTHERS THEN
        NULL;
    END;
    EXECUTE 'DROP INDEX IF EXISTS laplace.entities_highway_bits_gin';
END $do$;
